{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Another death game approaches... Are you interested in talking philosophy with the mastermind?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/02bebb628e5db707bd43041a5ecbc933.poster.avif?t=1771510336\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/02bebb628e5db707bd43041a5ecbc933.webm?t=1771510336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/02bebb628e5db707bd43041a5ecbc933.mp4?t=1771510336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/3391296cc3cf09e37b0aa79087da405d.avif?t=1771510336\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a standalone prologue to Red Crown Project, an upcoming death game visual novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a sci-fi setting with sci-fi vampires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a character-driven, linear story with a single ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- choices that influence the order of scenes you get to experience the story in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- one point-and-click section where you investigate a murder scene and search for clues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- estimated 3-4 hours of playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/a97f9dfdf63255487001637a0355aee1.avif?t=1771510336\" width=600 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/82454e42d30fa72b71305eaa00491191.avif?t=1771510336\" width=800 height=1150 /></span><i>Originally made for the &quot;Only One of Any Asset (O2A2) VN Jam 2023&quot; - a micro visual novel jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit - now featuring a heavily extended version of the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/extras/76c49c9eb4b44c46d694b2a3421600bb.avif?t=1771510336\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nayru</strong> - Creator<br><strong>Xolf</strong> - Co-writing<br><strong>Mori</strong> - Editing<br><strong>Marcianek</strong> - Logo, font, GUI design<br><strong>OddTillTheEnd</strong> - Music<br><strong>CyberSe7en</strong> - Coding Janitor</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2548780?t=1771510336","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2548780?t=1771510336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/ce41305055400e1365c4e0bd1fce13326818f2fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771510336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548780/ce41305055400e1365c4e0bd1fce13326818f2fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771510336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, including: general mature themes, strong language, use of tobacco, blood, death, mild body horror, and (non-explicit) sexual themes. Player discretion is advised.\r\n\r\nAll characters depicted in this game are 18 years of age or older."},"demos":[{"appid":4406940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Another death game approaches... Are you interested in talking philosophy with the mastermind?</h2><p c